+## rev0856 — streamfold sumcheck transcript binding
+
+- Added deterministic transcript-bound challenge derivation for the active
+  streamfold sumcheck toy lane.
+- Added reject fixtures for a bad challenge and omitted payload-manifest binding.
+- Added a parent-linked rev0856 PCD envelope that reconstructs and replays the
+  rev0855 lane before validating the new transcript-binding lane.
+- Added a payload admission contract for recovering the 17 canonical streamfold
+  payloads from a candidate root without pretending they are present in this
+  overlay.
+- Refactored the rev0855 validator into a historical checkpoint check in later
+  overlays.
+- Added a proofcore verifier surface audit and machine-readable verifier inventory.
+
+Publication remains blocked. No root license, notice, SPDX conclusion, RO-Crate
+rights assertion, SNARK proof, zero-knowledge proof, succinct proof, production
+Fiat-Shamir claim, or canonical streamfold payload bytes were invented.
